From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: own DSA and PPPoE flow identity and topology

Consolidate consecutive changes within this functional responsibility.
Retain the final implementation and its error handling directly.

Preserve C-tags on CPU-punted PPPoE control packets for ordinary VLAN
lower devices too. Without restoration, hardware flow activation strips
the tag and LCP cannot reach the VLAN-bound PPPoE socket.

Merged from:
  0651-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-define-flow-identity-and-transport.patch
  0652-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-manage-dsa-pppoe-flow-lifecycle.patch

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

